    "detailed_description": "This game consists of two interconnected parts. The first part is a visual novel about a girl named Alice, living in the near future. The pleasant visual presentation and a story based on real events will not leave you indifferent. You will learn about the dangers of careless internet usage and what it can lead to.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe second part symbolizes Alice's inner experiences and is presented in a top-down shooter style. You will face various enemies and navigate through a complex maze to help the girl not only escape but also find herself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on this journey with Alice and find out how it all ends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n\u2726 Engaging and diverse gameplay.<br />\r\n\u2726 Memorable storyline based on real events.<br />\r\n\u2726 6 Cyberpunk-style musical compositions.<br />\r\n\u2726 Multiple types of unique enemies.",
